{"id":"n62098-1-5","stage":4,"title":"뿌리내리다 · 生根","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62098-1-5-1","ko":"이 나무가 이 자리에 뿌리내린 게 삼백 년 전이래.","zh":"据说这棵树在三百年前就在这里扎根了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나무가","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리에","meaning":"位置，位子，地方","explanation":"자리：位置，位子，地方；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"1","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뿌리내린","meaning":"生根，扎根","explanation":"뿌리내리다：生根，扎根；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뿌리내리다","audio":"/audio/2bf9fd27d94731565f68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62098","senseId":"1","lemma":"뿌리내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼백","meaning":"300（汉字数词）","explanation":"삼백：300（汉字数词）","readings":[{"term":"삼백","audio":"/audio/619b1447e80ada4921c0.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseI